{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896030/extras/c95a7c4c8a986966927fee4b5d3a5a25.avif?t=1756344680\" width=616 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freelancers: Rogue Skies</strong> is an <strong>open-world, single-player space combat roguelite</strong> where every pilot is expendable and each death births a new story. Take control of ARC\u2011700 starfighters and dive into fast-paced dogfights across a handcrafted galaxy wracked by war between the UEG and Fringe Colonies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25aa High\u2011octane 1st/3rd\u2011person combat</strong><br>Master agile, cockpit-driven dogfighting. Dodge and strike like a real pilot. Enemy AI flank, evade, and hunt with ruthless precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896030/extras/2ade1a2319d1c0c5818ef97901baa544.poster.avif?t=1756344680\" width=780 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896030/extras/2ade1a2319d1c0c5818ef97901baa544.webm?t=1756344680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896030/extras/2ade1a2319d1c0c5818ef97901baa544.mp4?t=1756344680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25aa Permadeath with purpose</strong><br>When your ship explodes, press R to respawn as a new freelancer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25aa Fully open-world galaxy</strong><br>Fly freely between space systems, triggering dynamic events: convoy battles, derelict hauls, surprise ambushes, and black\u2011hole anomalies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896030/extras/1b0fc80ff6689b5b8e06289dc4103e08.poster.avif?t=1756344680\" width=780 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896030/extras/1b0fc80ff6689b5b8e06289dc4103e08.webm?t=1756344680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896030/extras/1b0fc80ff6689b5b8e06289dc4103e08.mp4?t=1756344680\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25aa Cosmetic identity, no balance tradeoffs</strong><br>Choose your ARC\u2011700 variant each run Prototype, Miner, Military, Racing, or Security. All stats are equal, but your paint and starting sector reflect your backstory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25aa Emergent stories run by you</strong><br>Fight for the UEG, go rogue, or blaze your own path. Every run is a narrative you craft: the pilot histories, battles survived, and legends born in space.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896030/extras/f4fcfa56f3b8d8fcce9b19ce7d2913ae.avif?t=1756344680\" width=616 height=140 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every Run Is A New Freelancer</strong> \u2013 Choose paint and identity, then jump into a random corner of the galaxy. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open Galaxy, No Invisible Walls</strong> \u2013 Seamless travel between systems, each with handcrafted tactical arenas and hidden threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Dogfights</strong> \u2013 Engage carriers, patrols, and fringe raiders with smart AI. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Persistent Power</strong> \u2013 Clean slate each run. True roguelite tension with optional session saves so you can land and resume.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmetic-Only Variants</strong> \u2013 Pick your ship\u2019s look and lore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Faction Conflict</strong> \u2013 Fight UEG forces, ambush Fringe colonies, or run your own freelance war.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3896030?t=1756344680","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896030/059a67215a4a23df5f72d9a559e96d895afd1cd6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756344680","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896030/0637bc5bc8f6df54347bd9d47425835108ee655d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756344680","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896030/0637bc5bc8f6df54347bd9d47425835108ee655d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756344680","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3935150,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896030/extras/c95a7c4c8a986966927fee4b5d3a5a25.avif?t=1756344680\" width=616 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freelancers: Rogue Skies</strong> is an <strong>open-world, single-player space combat roguelite</strong> where every pilot is expenda